  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 1015, Alice''s basis for computing gain is the donor''s carryover basis of $15,000. Her gain is $24,000 − $15,000 = $9,000. Because the donee tacks the donor''s holding period under Section 1223(2), and the mother held the stock long-term, the gain is long-term capital gain.
