-- Q2573: Property Transactions: Gains/Losses [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 1222(6), the $12,000 short-term loss is netted against the $5,000 long-term gain, yielding a $7,000 net short-term capital loss. Per Section 1211(b), $3,000 is deductible against ordinary income, and the remaining $4,000 carries forward under Section 1212(b) retaining its short-term character.
Wrong (B): The net loss retains its short-term character because the short-term loss exceeds the long-term gain; it does not become a long-term loss.
